+- **Flaky-behavior diagnosis:** Examine repetitions on comparable case/expected revision, build, environment, fixture, isolation and time window. Differentiate nondeterministic product behavior, test harness, setup, infrastructure and unexplained variability. A flaky hypothesis does not downgrade a confirmed defect or overwrite attempt results.
